Statement of modifications (GPL-3.0 section 5a)
-----------------------------------------------

The following changes were made to the upstream Velorn source. Each is
downstream of upstream commit a8fd71b on branch cdx/vendor-0.3.25.

2026-08-24  Rebranded the application surface from "Velorn" to "CDX Studio"
            across the renderer and the Electron main process: window and app
            identity, splash markup, error dialogs, installer labels, the
            injected ComfyUI bridge display name, and the MCP tool-description
            surface.

            Not renamed, deliberately: the lowercase `velorn*` and
            `comfystudio*` identifiers. These are wire protocol shared between
            the renderer, the Electron main process, the injected ComfyUI
            Python bridge, and existing on-disk project files
            (`project.comfystudio`). They are compatibility surface, and
            renaming them would break existing projects and erase provenance.

            Upstream attribution in package.json ("Velorn contributors", the
            VelornLabs repository URLs) is preserved unchanged.

2026-08-24  Added src/services/contextStack.js — a single resolver for the
            layers of creative context that feed a generation, reporting per
            layer what it contributes, whether it is ready, and why not.

2026-08-24  Added src/services/movementRefs.js and wired the previously
            unreferenced src/services/kimodoMotion.js — movement as a fourth
            reference kind bound to characters, realised as SMPL-X22 motion.

2026-08-24  Changed src/components/storyboard/boardShared.jsx so prompt
            assembly draws its reference context from the context stack rather
            than re-deriving each layer, and
            src/components/StoryboardWorkspace.jsx to record context
            provenance on each generation.

2026-08-24  Extended src/services/projectListing.js and
            src/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx with franchise grouping,
            production-type filtering and sorting, and per-type project
            displays including brand and offering context for advertising work.

2026-08-24  Added src/components/studio/ContextStackPanel.jsx,
            MovementReferencePanel.jsx and BrandContextPanel.jsx.

2026-08-24  Added the plugin/ directory: a Claude Code plugin exposing the
            MCP server, skills, commands and an agent for driving CDX Studio.

2026-08-24  Preserved the upstream README at docs/upstream/README.velorn.md.


